  "details": "First, currently there is only one instance of \"Avatar\" - String №22723\n\nSecond, there is `earmuff-follow-mode::Camera` (№76720) but there is **no** `earmuff-follow-mode::Avatar`.\n\nAt least in Russian, we need to use casus instrumentalis (i.e. \"for Avatar\" form) in context of earmuff follow mode switch: \"Область следует за камер**ой**\" / \"Область следует за аватар**ом**\" \n\nSo, I am asking here to make separate `earmuff-follow-mode::Avatar` key.",
